{#- Macho Nachos toppings (client 2026-11-03): black & white, no logo,
    for the counter. Staff point at it to show what comes on the nachos,
    and the customer says what to leave off. The list is `toppings` above:
    the Taco Salad's Taco Modifier in Square, plus salsa and sour cream.
    When Square's list changes, change it here and print a new sheet. -#}
<div class="canvas sign sign--bw nachos">
    <div class="sign-heading">
        <h2 class="p-display sign-heading-title">Macho Nachos</h2>
        <p class="nachos-sub">come with</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="nachos-list">
        {%- for t in toppings %}
        <li>{{ t }}</li>
        {%- endfor %}
    </ul>

    <div class="sign-spacer"></div>
    <p class="nachos-foot">Don&rsquo;t want one? Just tell us.</p>
</div>
